---
// AuthorCard.astro
// Placed at the bottom of every blog post to establish E-E-A-T signals.
// Single-author site — no props required.
---

<aside class="author-card" aria-label="About the author">
	<div class="author-card-inner">
		<p class="label author-card-kicker">Written by</p>
		<h3 class="author-card-name">
			<a href="/about/">Gareth Winter</a>
		</h3>
		<p class="author-card-bio">
			Former Creative Director at Sky Sports and Team Sky. Inside British cycling's greatest decade —
			Wiggins, Froome, Thomas, Hoy. Now writing the version the press office would never let me publish.
		</p>
		<a href="/about/" class="author-card-link">Full story &rarr;</a>
	</div>
</aside>

<style>
	.author-card {
		max-width: var(--measure);
		margin: var(--s-9) auto 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		padding-top: var(--s-7);
	}

	.author-card-kicker {
		margin-bottom: var(--s-2);
		color: var(--subtle);
	}

	.author-card-name {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 400;
		margin: 0 0 var(--s-4);
		line-height: 1.1;
	}

	.author-card-name a {
		color: var(--ink);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: opacity 150ms ease;
	}

	.author-card-name a:hover {
		opacity: 0.6;
	}

	.author-card-bio {
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		color: var(--muted);
		line-height: 1.65;
		max-width: 54ch;
		margin: 0 0 var(--s-5);
	}

	.author-card-link {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-xs);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--ink);
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
		padding-bottom: 2px;
		transition: border-color 150ms ease;
	}

	.author-card-link:hover {
		border-color: var(--ink);
	}
</style>
